  "title": "Ginger Glazed Mahi Mahi",
  "description": "This Asian-style ginger sauce for mahi mahi fillets is a snap to make with a fresh ginger, honey, soy sauce, balsamic vinegar, and garlic marinade.",
  "authors": [
    "DIANA F"
  ],
